@startuml F8.1-D04-timeout-cliente
title F8.1-D04 — Timeout 5s no cliente
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "WebApp" as WebApp

User -> WebApp: digita termo
WebApp -> WebApp: GET /search\nAbortController 5s
note right of WebApp
  timeout — abort;
  resposta descartada
end note
WebApp --> User: erro tente novamente

@enduml
